{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gohawaii-watersports/items/476798/", "pk": 476798, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gohawaii-watersports/", "pk": 100571, "shortname": "gohawaii-watersports", "name": "Go Hawaii Watersports", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Parasailing", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 6, "unicode": "Parasailing", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 1.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 1.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 1000, "description": "##Highlights\n- 45-60 minutes on the boat, 6-8 minutes in the air.\n- Our parasailing adventures are available throughout the week\n- Open to thrill-seekers ages 5 and up who weigh at least 50 pounds.\n- Safety is our top priority, and all necessary equipment is provided and required.\n\n***Early Bird Special Rate available on 8am times**\n\n##About Us\nAloha! We have been flying since 2013 and offers outstanding service and an unparalleled experience. Our parasailing tours are operated by the most experienced crews in Hawaii, and offered at the lowest prices you’ll find anywhere.\n\nWe’re conveniently located in Kewalo Basin, just 5 minutes away from Waikiki Hotels, offering parasailing tours along the world-famous Waikiki Beach! Best of all, absolutely no experience is necessary!\n\nHave you ever imagined viewing Hawaii from the sky? Then what are you waiting for! Their parasailing excursions are perfect for you. Even if you are afraid of heights, parasailing is a peaceful ride in the sky! Feel free to fly like a bird as you soar high above the ocean’s surface and enjoy fantastic panoramic views of Diamond Head and the Waikiki skylines!\nViews of the Diamond Head and Waikiki skylines!\n\n- No experience is necessary to fly!\n- Up to 3 people per flight!\n- Up to ~10 minutes of flight time!\n- Up to 1000 feet of flight line!\n\n\n*A $7 fuel charge is applied per person", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "##Waivers\n**Please make sure to sign a waiver before you arrive.**\n[Start here](https://mono.wherewolf.co.nz/8ah65p). \n\nYou may only sign waivers for yourself and individuals for whom you are the legal guardian. A valid photo ID must be uploaded with the waiver. If the participant is a minor or does not have a valid photo ID, a clear selfie may be uploaded as an alternative to the ID.\n\nIf you made this booking for multiple people, please forward this email to them or share the direct link: [https://mono.wherewolf.co.nz/8ah65p](https://mono.wherewolf.co.nz/8ah65p)\n\nIf you have previously signed this waiver for a different activity with our company, you are not required to sign it again—just let us know upon arrival.\n\n\n##Recommended Preparation\nPlease check in 30 minutes before your scheduled departure time. Arrange your transportation in advance as it is not included. If you are driving a car, parking is available onsite for $2/hour. Payments can only be made via the app; there is no option to pay with cash or credit card directly. The vessel departs from Kewalo Harbor, just 10–15 minutes away from most Waikiki hotels. [See Driving Directions and location information here](https://gohawaiiwatersports.com/location/).\n\n##For best experience of this Parasailing tour bring the following items:\n- Change of clothes\n- Camera\n- Swimwear\n- Sunscreen\n- Sunglasses\n- Towel\n- Tablets or patches to prevent seasickness if you are prone to getting seasick\n\n##Included\n- Equipment and harness for parasailing.\n- Life vests.\n\n##Not Included\n- Pick up / Drop off. You will have to arrange for transportation yourself.\n- Alcoholic drinks & food are not allowed.\n- No restrooms on board.\n- Fuel Surcharge to be paid upon arrival ($9.00 Per Person) \n- **Gratuities are not included in the tour price. While never expected, they are always appreciated as a way to recognize exceptional service.**", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Parasailing age 5+, Observers age 2+ • Available Daily", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gohawaii-watersports/items/476798/images/1743276/", "pk": 1743276, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/SXOUPA1HT5KuUuXkweWk", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/SXOUPA1HT5KuUuXkweWk", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gohawaii-watersports/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gohawaii-watersports/items/476798/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/SXOUPA1HT5KuUuXkweWk", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/SXOUPA1HT5KuUuXkweWk", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gohawaii-watersports/items/476798/images/1001295/", "pk": 1001295, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/3gm6nhiTDCOuIWifrwGz", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/3gm6nhiTDCOuIWifrwGz", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gohawaii-watersp